      "body": "Good catch, I have missed that. I'm generally somewhat skeptical now if there is even a point in clearing these anymore, since we have reached agreement that we can drop the constant-time requirements for them (see discussion https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/pull/1914#issuecomment-5406687974 ff.). \r\n\r\nAdded clearing of the label tweak and the final tweak for consistency (we can always remove those later if we have consensus that it's not necessary).",
